    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: any hills or rocky plains.\n\nIronbloom forms dense rosettes of dark green leaves around a stem capped by a dull red flower. Its foliage feels metallic and produces a faint ringing sound when struck, so it must be dried and ground with a stone pestle before use. The resulting mineral-rich powder tastes of blood and wet earth but is valued by miners and soldiers for the resilience it imparts. For 1 hour, you gain a +1-item bonus to Fortitude saving throws.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
